      {
        "id": 132939,
        "name": "Readinguselessmessages",
        "username": "Readinguselessmessag",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/7ea924/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-02T02:24:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, that could work, too. &nbsp;Matching decks would be interesting, but luck is involved with any game. &nbsp;If a team gets a bad draw, then so be it. &nbsp;Knowing in advance would certainly help a team, and not allowing repeated play for heroes brings a lot of pre-game strategy to the event. &nbsp;I just wish I could find enough interested people in my area. &nbsp;In the model, you wouldn't necessarily have to have teams play head to head. &nbsp;Losers always leave until the last man is standing. &nbsp;I like it!</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
